# Firebase — kept out of the repository on purpose.
# These hold this project's own Firebase identifiers and Android API key.
# They are not secrets in the strict sense (they ship inside the APK and can
# be read out of it), but keeping them out avoids anyone else spending this
# project's Firebase quota. Copy the .example files beside them to build.
# Real protection for a published app comes from Firebase Security Rules and
# from restricting the API key to the app's package name + SHA-1 fingerprint.
android/app/google-services.json
lib/firebase_options.dart

